<title>USA: USDA says Pakistan in PL480 pact for $25 mln wheat.</title>
<headline>USDA says Pakistan in PL480 pact for $25 mln wheat.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Friday Pakistan signed an agreement under  Title I of Public Law 480 for the sale of $20 million worth of U.S. wheat or about 110,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>The supply period is fiscal 1997, USDA said.</p>
</text>
